{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grannies on Wheels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of fearless grandmothers in monster trucks and smash, bash, and crash your way across single-screen arenas where the terrain shifts beneath your wheels. Every jar of jam represents a life and your opponents are hungry for both the sweet stuff and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/a3ad52aecbb5bdc1499d34add7467130.poster.avif?t=1772805465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/a3ad52aecbb5bdc1499d34add7467130.webm?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/a3ad52aecbb5bdc1499d34add7467130.mp4?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >School\u2019s out for the summer, and one unlucky grandchild is left with Grandma\u2026 and a lump of modelling clay. But boredom doesn\u2019t stand a chance. With a little imagination and a lot of clay the world\u2019s wackiest toy set is born: Grannies on Wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/8a961ff18741840e46bf66920bc4af33.poster.avif?t=1772805465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/8a961ff18741840e46bf66920bc4af33.webm?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/8a961ff18741840e46bf66920bc4af33.mp4?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is couch gaming at its finest: chaotic, colourful, and full of laugh-out-loud moments with up to 4 friends. Every match delivers unpredictable moments and wild challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Truck Mayhem:</strong> Drive over-the-top vehicles piloted by equally over-the-top grandmothers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Terrain:</strong> The ground doesn\u2019t just look different, it changes how your truck handles, and can even reshape the whole arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jam-Lives:</strong> Keep your jars safe and steal your opponents\u2019 to stay in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game:</strong> Play with up to 4 friends on a single screen in classic party-game style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Opponents</strong>: No friends around - No problem! Bot Grannies jump right in, and they\u2019re just as unpredictable and ruthless as your best buddy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games Madness:</strong> Switch it up with a variety of quirky challenges for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics \u2013 and lots of them!</strong> Flags flap in the wind, trucks tumble, and opponents go flying, making every round hilariously unpredictable.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.poster.avif?t=1772805465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.webm?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.mp4?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for chaos, collisions, and clay-crafted carnage, because in Grannies on Wheels, age is just a number\u2026 and destruction is timeless.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950840?t=1772805465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950840?t=1772805465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/e81e92737e59469d8602e8b1ad81c52e3c245294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772805465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/e81e92737e59469d8602e8b1ad81c52e3c245294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772805465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grannies on Wheels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of fearless grandmothers in monster trucks and smash, bash, and crash your way across single-screen arenas where the terrain shifts beneath your wheels. Every jar of jam represents a life and your opponents are hungry for both the sweet stuff and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/a3ad52aecbb5bdc1499d34add7467130.poster.avif?t=1772805465\" width