class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jam-Lives:</strong> Keep your jars safe and steal your opponents\u2019 to stay in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Game:</strong> Play with up to 4 friends on a single screen in classic party-game style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Opponents</strong>: No friends around - No problem! Bot Grannies jump right in, and they\u2019re just as unpredictable and ruthless as your best buddy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games Madness:</strong> Switch it up with a variety of quirky challenges for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics \u2013 and lots of them!</strong> Flags flap in the wind, trucks tumble, and opponents go flying, making every round hilariously unpredictable.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.poster.avif?t=1772805465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.webm?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/extras/85fcff6fb868ebe073b5e2902d6ab665.mp4?t=1772805465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for chaos, collisions, and clay-crafted carnage, because in Grannies on Wheels, age is just a number\u2026 and destruction is timeless.</p>","developers":["Robot Laser Shark"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950840/ffb483f3446b51f844ce042c4545291bbe6dfdb3/header.jpg?t=1772805465","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</str